   "html": "<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-261000 alignright\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG_2548.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"251\" height=\"335\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG_2548.jpg 360w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG_2548-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 251px) 100vw, 251px\">Louisville, KY – 5/14/2024 – Vac2Go, a leading provider of vacuum truck rental services, proudly announces its recognition as the winner of the prestigious Deal of the Year Award by ACG (Association for Corporate Growth) Kentucky. This honor celebrates Vac2Go &amp; Argosy Private Equity’s exceptional transaction in 2023 and the Vac2Go executive team’s drive for corporate growth.</p>\n<p>The Deal of the Year Award, bestowed each year by ACG Kentucky, celebrates standout transactions that showcase innovation, influence, and the generation of value. Vac2Go’s remarkable achievement underscores its commitment to economic growth, making it a deserving recipient of this prestigious recognition.</p>\n<p>The award-winning deal exemplifies Vac2Go’s commitment to innovation, customer focus, and industry leadership. Through strategic foresight and diligent execution, Vac2Go has solidified its position as a key player in the vacuum truck rental market, driving growth and delivering unparalleled value to its clients.</p>\n<p>Vac2Go remains steadfast in its mission to revolutionize the vacuum truck rental industry, driving innovation, and delivering value to clients across the United States. The company looks forward to continuing its journey of growth, guided by its core values of integrity, collaboration, and customer satisfaction.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #e01f30;\"><b>About Vac2Go:</b></span></p>\n<p>Vac2Go is a leading vacuum truck rental company operating a network of eight strategically located rental and service locations throughout the United States. Vac2Go offers customers one of the broadest and most diverse fleets of modern, high-quality vacuum equipment in the industry. In addition, all locations offer repair &amp; maintenance services, used equipment sales, and after-market parts and accessories. Vac2Go currently operates in Alabama, Florida, Indiana, Kentucky, Ohio, South Carolina, Tennessee, and Texas.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" hidden=\"\"><strong style=\"color: #e01f30;\">Industrial Excavation</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong style=\"color: #e01f30;\">Disaster/Spill Cleanup</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong style=\"color: #e01f30;\">Emergencies/Rescues</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong style=\"color: #e01f30;\">Waste Hauling</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
